  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _replicas:
  - Dialogues:
    - Welcome to the manual of the Mann Co. Home Protection Unit ver. 1.13!
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - This security system will impale any intruders (and only in rare cases pets)!
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - Step 1)
    - Select a THREE DIGIT CODE
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - Step 2)
    - Enter the code to activate the spikes.
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - Step 4)
    - To deactivate the spikes, enter the code again.
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - In case the code was entered incorrecly, pull the lever to reset it.
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - 'Hint: In case you''re prone to forgetting codes, write it down somewhere.'
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - (Sani has written something here...)
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - (It says "CALENDER!!!")
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
